.el .ds Aq '
.TH devin-desktop 1  "desktop " 
.SH NAME
devin\-desktop \- Open Devin Desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin desktop\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIARGS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open Devin Desktop
.PP
Launches the Devin Desktop app matching this CLI\*(Aqs channel (e.g. `devin\-insiders desktop` opens Devin Desktop Insiders), forwarding any extra arguments to its launcher.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
[\fIARGS\fR]
Arguments forwarded to the Devin Desktop launcher (e.g. paths)
